{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212610","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212610","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121261001:0":{"text":"네 이름... 알루라가 아닌 것 같아.","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，阿露拉好像并不是你的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465EF2EA20DD37F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121261002:0":{"text":"그 이름은 네 어머니의 이름이야. 그러니까, 진짜 어머니 말이야.","source_cn":"而是你母亲的名字——我是说，真正的母亲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x272A5C263EBA27D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121261003:0":{"text":"진짜... 엄마.","source_cn":"真正的……母亲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x176CD5DA294A2B91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121261004:0":{"text":"만나고 싶어. 만날 수 있을까?","source_cn":"我想见到她，我能见到她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6BB8CB02621CB05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121261005:0":{"text":"나도 모르겠어... 포기하지 말고 계속해서 찾아보자!","source_cn":"我也不知道……再找找看吧！别放弃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71FC7E301985947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蕾